OL,3,AFrance's government under pressure
OL,4,Aafter weekend of widespread violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance's Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,7,FLecornu is holding a crisis cabinet
OL,8,Fmeeting on Monday to assess a weekend
OL,9,Fof violence and looting across the
OL,10,Fcountry, in what were some of the worst
OL,11,Fscenes of public disorder in modern
OL,12,FFrench history.
OL,14,FOn Saturday over half a million mainly
OL,15,Fpeaceful protesters demonstrated
OL,16,Fagainst rising living costs and
OL,17,Fdwindling access to decent public
OL,18,Fservices, including a good state
OL,19,Feducation. But the protests turned
OL,20,Fnasty after groups of black-clad,
OL,21,Fmasked activists and vandals appeared.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
