OL,3,AFrance's government under pressure
OL,4,Aafter weekend of widespread violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn estimated 1,500 shops and businesses
OL,7,Fwere looted and destroyed. Riot police
OL,8,Ffired tear gas and turned water cannon
OL,9,Fon crowds. They were seen hitting
OL,10,Fpeople with batons in several places.
OL,11,FFrance's interior ministry said about
OL,12,F1,000 police officers were injured on
OL,13,FSaturday, seven of them seriously.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
